                    <app loc="3">
                        <lem source="bib:Kuppusamy+Vijayavenugopal2006_01">nākan</lem>
                        <rdg source="bib:SubrahmanyaAiyer1932_01">na<unclear>k</unclear>kaṉ</rdg>
                        <note><ptr target="bib:Kuppusamy+al2010_01"/>: <q>The word <foreign>nākaṉ</foreign> occurring in the third line is given as <foreign>nakkaṉ</foreign> in SII edition; but it is very clear in the wall.</q></note>
                    </app>     
                    
                </listApp>
            </div>
            
            <div type="translation" source="bib:Kuppusamy+al2010_01">
                <p n="1-2">26th year <supplied reason="subaudible">of the reign</supplied> of śrī-Kaṉṉara-tēvar.</p>
                <p n="2-5">The stones <supplied reason="subaudible">slabs</supplied> donated by Nami Nākaṉ Caṅkaraṉ, for this tier, are four.</p>
